# Fuzzy Shower Temperature Controller

## Overview

This project demonstrates a Fuzzy Logic Controller combined with
Machine Learning for maintaining a comfortable shower temperature.

---

## Features

✔ Machine Learning Classification

✔ Random Forest Model

✔ Fuzzy Logic Controller

✔ Temperature Simulation

✔ Automatic Valve Control

✔ Temperature Graph

✔ Accuracy Report

---

## Temperature Levels

Low

Medium

High

---

## Input

Current Temperature

Desired Temperature

---

## Output

Hot Valve %

Cold Valve %

Final Temperature

Comfort Level

---

## Technologies

Python

NumPy

Pandas

Scikit Learn

Scikit Fuzzy

Matplotlib

---

## Run

python main.py